Package: epiviewVPD
Title: Dashboard of Facility Vaccine Coverage and Vaccine-Preventable Disease Cases
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michala", "Carlson", "madmc@umn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A suite of different visualization options for vaccination coverage
  in schools, childcares, or other facilities/geographic units, built by the 
  Midwest Analytics and Disease Modeling Center (MADMC). Originally made for
  measles and MMR coverage in Minnesota, it has been generalized to allow multiple
  geographic areas and jurisdictions to run with their own data. An optional
  RShiny wrapper is also included, to make more interconnected visualizations.
